  "limitations": [
    "Calls from shop/Dynamic.java are unassessed: reflective Method.invoke and calls through interface-typed parameters do not identify one static target.",
    "Calls to JDK methods (String.length) have no node in the fixture and are not facts. A lambda is not a symbol: calls in its body belong to the enclosing method, and its implementation of Listener.onSave is not a fact.",
    "Known FN: a static call qualified by its class name (Util.format(...)) is not resolved, though arity would select Util.format or Util.format~2 (Repo.save).",
    "Known FN: super.save() is not resolved to the base-class method (Repo.save -> BaseRepo.save).",
    "Known FN: a call on a new-expression receiver (new Cache().put(item)) is not resolved ({anonymous}.onSave -> Cache.put).",
    "Known FP and FN: new Listener() { ... } records a call to the interface Listener instead of the anonymous class it instantiates (Repo.anonymous).",
    "Known FN: method-level implements (Repo.save -> Saver.save, {anonymous}.onSave -> Listener.onSave) is only derived for Go."
  ]
